        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S04",
        "text": "以前写一篇公众号文章是这样的",
        "start": 17.85,
        "end": 20.73,
        "duration": 2.88,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S05",
        "text": "改稿，1 小时",
        "start": 20.97,
        "end": 23.12,
        "duration": 2.15,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S06",
        "text": "不是 Claude Code 帮我写了文章，是它帮我把「想」和「等灵感」的时间压缩到了几乎为零",
        "start": 23.36,
        "end": 31.4,
        "duration": 8.04,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S07",
        "text": "你有没有这种感觉，读了很多书，记住了 10%，用到了 1%",
        "start": 31.64,
        "end": 36.18,
        "duration": 4.54,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S08",
        "text": "以前这个过程需要我自己花 1 小时「想」，现在 5 分钟搞定",
        "start": 36.42,
        "end": 41.17,
        "duration": 4.75,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S09",
        "text": "写文章最难的不是写，是开始写",
        "start": 41.41,
        "end": 44.09,
        "duration": 2.68,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S10",
        "text": "以前我要「想好写什么」才能开始，现在只需要说「帮我写」，它就帮我写了",
        "start": 44.33,
        "end": 50.11,
        "duration": 5.78,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S11",
        "text": "当然，AI 写的不能直接用，还需要我改，但它帮我跨过了「开始」这个最大的障碍",
