        "end": 56.96,
        "duration": 6.61,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S12",
        "text": "从「有想法」到「有草稿」，可能只需要 10 分钟",
        "start": 57.2,
        "end": 60.71,
        "duration": 3.51,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S13",
        "text": "这个 10 分钟的跨越，是执行力最大的提升",
        "start": 60.95,
        "end": 64.66,
        "duration": 3.71,
        "pause_after": 0.24,
        "emphasis_words": []
      },
      {
        "sentence_id": "S14",
        "text": "第一步，让 Claude Code 分析这周的读书笔记，推荐选题",
